# Which life-verb a Centroid pet may take, and who already owns the rule.
# crew_op does not implement these. mine becomes a DESIGNATE row for df-hq's existing dig tick.
# talk, offer, buy and build stay deskopoly. farm is OPEN until a real plant verb exists.
ROUTE | mine | df-hq | dig | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | place | crew | place | -
ROUTE | talk | deskopoly | talk | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | offer | deskopoly | offer | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | buy | deskopoly | buy | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | build | deskopoly | build | verbs.pdl
ROUTE | farm | OPEN | plant | -
